# FLAX OS💎
> Ultrapkg — the lightweight .deb manager for Flax system.

Ultrapkg is designed as a secure, lightweight package helper for Debian/Ubuntu-style local packages.
It keeps the common apt and aptitude workflows available, but does not depend on the heavy external package manager stack for normal operations.

## Version

This project starts at v0.1.0.

## Command model

- `ultrapkg install <package.deb>`: lightweight install wrapper
- `ultrapkg -dpkg <package.deb>`: direct `.deb` path install wrapper
- `ultrapkg apt ...`: apt-like commands implemented locally
- `ultrapkg aptitude ...`: aptitude-like queries implemented locally
- `ultrapkg info <package.deb>`: inspect package metadata directly from the archive

## Security and design

- no direct dependency on external `apt` or `aptitude` for standard operations
- local receipt database stored under a controlled root prefix
- path validation for package files and root directories
- version comparison implemented in-process
- minimal resource usage and no unnecessary background services

## Build

```bash
cmake -S . -B build
cmake --build build
ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure
```

